<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Discovery of a Hematopoietic Manifold in scGPT Yields a Method for Extracting Performant Algorithms from Biological Foundation Model Internals" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In Discovery of a Hematopoietic Manifold in scGPT Yields a Method for Extracting Performant Algorithms from Biological Foundation Model Internals" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SSx17.SSS0.Px1" title="In S17. Metric-level paired significance, orientation summary, and classification deltas ‣ Supplementary Material ‣ Discovery of a Hematopoietic Manifold in scGPT Yields a Method for Extracting Performant Algorithms from Biological Foundation Model Internals" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Scope closure and residual caveats in Robust V2.</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
