</figure>
</section>
<section id="Sx1.SSx16" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">S16. Hybrid topology-preserving sweep</h3>

<div id="Sx1.SSx16.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx1.SSx16.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The hybrid runs defined a clear Pareto-like frontier between developmental branch readability and stage-distance alignment. In the <span id="Sx1.SSx16.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">strong-topology sweep</span>, the best run (<math id="Sx1.SSx16.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{\mathrm{topo}}=0.08" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>topo</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.08</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{\mathrm{topo}}=0.08</annotation></semantics></math>) produced the clearest branch geometry (branch silhouette <math id="Sx1.SSx16.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.102" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.102</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.102</annotation></semantics></math>; stem<math id="Sx1.SSx16.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math>(plasma minus B-cell) radial proxy <math id="Sx1.SSx16.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="+4.167" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>4.167</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">+4.167</annotation></semantics></math>), and retained strong subtype separation (CD4/CD8 AUC <math id="Sx1.SSx16.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.934" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.934</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.934</annotation></semantics></math>, monocyte/macrophage AUC <math id="Sx1.SSx16.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.914" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.914</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.914</annotation></semantics></math>). The tradeoff was reduced global alignment (corr<math id="Sx1.SSx16.p1.m7" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{}_{\mathrm{resid}}=0.472" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>resid</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.472</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{}_{\mathrm{resid}}=0.472</annotation></semantics></math>).</p>
</div>
<div id="Sx1.SSx16.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx1.SSx16.p2.1" class="ltx_p">In the <span id="Sx1.SSx16.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">conservative sweep</span>, the best run (<math id="Sx1.SSx16.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{\mathrm{topo}}=0.005" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>topo</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.005</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{\mathrm{topo}}=0.005</annotation></semantics></math>) preserved alignment (corr <math id="Sx1.SSx16.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.634" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.634</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.634</annotation></semantics></math>, corr<math id="Sx1.SSx16.p2.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{}_{\mathrm{resid}}=0.632" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>resid</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.632</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{}_{\mathrm{resid}}=0.632</annotation></semantics></math>) while keeping strong CD4/CD8 separability (<math id="Sx1.SSx16.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.911" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.911</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.911</annotation></semantics></math>); monocyte/macrophage separability dropped relative to pure cell-trained transfer (<math id="Sx1.SSx16.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.851" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.851</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.851</annotation></semantics></math> vs <math id="Sx1.SSx16.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.937" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.937</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.937</annotation></semantics></math>), and topology gains were more modest (branch silhouette <math id="Sx1.SSx16.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.037" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.037</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.037</annotation></semantics></math>).</p>
</div>
